        "stderr": "bash: kill: (ab12:3) - No such process\nbash: kill: ab12:x: arguments must be process or job IDs\n"
      },
      "note": "mirage's own operand: owner:pid names a process another workspace on a shared store runs, as ps lists it, where bash refuses any non-numeric operand as not a process or job ID. One no live workspace runs is no such process, and ps -p of it selects nothing."
